# Live UI preview

Any UI change, including UI that is not pushed yet, must include a clickable live preview URL. Screenshots alone are not enough.

- Run the Next server from the working tree: `npm run dev -- --hostname 0.0.0.0 --port 3000`.
- Put the exact URL in the reply and at the top of the PR description.
- A preview tunnel or other ephemeral public URL is enough. A static mock is last resort.
- Do not merge. Do not deploy unless Devo says merge and deploy.

The product spine is the HIGH PURITY climb: Toiletries, Wearables, Utility, Furniture, Structure, Altered, Infrastructure. Anti-petroleum. Do not replace that spine with a single product.
